  {
   "id": "escape-from-ever-after-211624@3",
   "gameId": "escape-from-ever-after-211624",
   "displayName": "Hotfix 3",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-01-27T09:52:04.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thank you so much for all your continued support! The reception has just been incredible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "One request we saw come up often was clearer feedback when missing a guard window. We spent today implementing a new optional “Guard Feedback” feature that lets you know why a timed block failed—whether it was too early or too late:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42649549/a8129d70feff1b5aff5b21680569523f8a21284a.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42649549/99b4403926a98dec27e3fefd67e2e2e21b003bf8.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "New “Guard Feedback” option: When enabled, the game will display whether a missed guard was too early or too late. You can toggle this on or off in Options → Game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Collectibles Menu Update: Collectibles are now numbered in the Collectibles menu for easier tracking.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a bed for free healing before the Chapter 2 Miniboss",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bugfixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue in Stairs of Success where a stacked gnome enemy could spawn incorrectly in the overworld.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed disappearing stairs in the Final Chapter",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks again for all the feedback and support; it genuinely helps shape the game. More updates soon! 🙌",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
