  {
   "id": "escape-from-ever-after-211624@post-2026-01-25",
   "gameId": "escape-from-ever-after-211624",
   "displayName": "Patch Notes #1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-01-25T08:10:51.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're absolutely overwhelmed by the amazing reception Escape from Ever After has received since launch! Being at the top of Steam's \"New & Trending\" for almost 2 full days now is just surreal. And we really appreciate all the reviews we've gotten so far, thank you to everyone who left one!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The discussions have also been incredible to see, and we're constantly reading every piece of feedback you share with us.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please keep playing, leaving reviews, and joining the discussions! Your input is directly helping us make the game even better.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Since release, we've been hard at work pushing several updates to mainly address bugs and some rare crashes that have been encountered. Here's what we've fixed so far:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bugfixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fix rare crash when initiating battle with egg enemy in Dungeon",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix enemy items duplicating when running away from battle",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix visual glitches in Enchanted Woods",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix softlock when interacting with Telepager menu too quickly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix softlock caused by a bomb plant explosion and battle triggering at the same time",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix bestiary achievement triggering when it shouldn’t",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix collision bug in Happy Howl Hollow that allowed players out of bounds",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix crash that can happen when changing partners while one is recovering",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix Beatrice’s emails showing up after completing quest",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Extra hint clarification in Enchanted Woods musical maze puzzle",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tinder’s Blazing Whirlwind ability can now also be controlled with the d-pad",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Localization",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "In Chinese translation, fix discrepancies between items in Pinocchio’s Birthday Party sidequest",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "General updates and improvements to Portuguese translation",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the coming days, we are going to focus more on quality of life updates to address some of the common pieces of feedback we've been reading.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hope you continue to enjoy playing!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
